                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='4001' id='13' name='Data Freshness Value' show-title='false' w='8472' x='8578' y='8666'>
                <layout-cache cell-count-h='1' cell-count-w='1' type-h='cell' type-w='cell' />
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='977' forceUpdate='true' friendly-name='Dashboard Name Text' h='11667' id='10' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='68403' x='17050' y='1000'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='24'>Data Streams: Reconciliation README</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone alt-text='DH Logo' friendly-name='Delivery Hero Logo' h='11667' id='6' is-scaled='1' param='Image/image 2 (1).png' type-v2='bitmap' w='13747' x='85453' y='1000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d61f26' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='81444' id='153' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='12667'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='81444' id='150' type-v2='text' w='49167' x='833' y='12667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run>This report aims to provide an overview of the data quality of the KPIs that can be derived from the data that is sent to Data Streams. It is updated daily and the latest date the report has data for can be found in the header above.

Please direct questions &amp; feedback to data-platform-governance@deliveryhero.com or in </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2'>#data-streams-support</run>
                <run> on Slack.&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Incentives Streams KPIs</run>
                <run>
The platform logic for pulling these KPIs from the platform DWHs can be found in the incentive* scripts in the Data Hub </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4996b2'>datahub-airflow repo, under dags/govops</run>
                <run>

The central logic is based upon Data Streams Incentive Transactions Stream &amp; Incentive Stream. The exact logic of the mapping can be found in reconciliation_incentive_transactions_data_platforms.sql and reconciliation_incentive_transactions_data_streams.sql

Then the logic for reconciling the two datasets is here: reconciliation_incentive_transactions_datastreams_vs_platforms.sql and includes the currency conversions into EUR using the same exchange rates for both sources. The table is then aggregated for tableau folloing the logic established here: reconciliation_incentives_datastreams_vs_platforms_agg.sql.

The KPIs covered in this report are the </run>
                <run bold='true'>Correctness</run>
                <run> of the following KPIs, where correctness is always measured as </run>
                <run italic='true'>1 minus the absolute difference between Data Streams and the provided platform reconciliation table value, divided by the platform value</run>
                <run>. i.e. any difference, high or low, will reduce the correctness below 100%.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='81444' id='191' type-v2='text' w='49167' x='50000' y='12667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true'>Total Incentive Amount</run>
                <run>- Total incentive amount in local currency. Granted to the customer, regardless of source or type. Including joker, delivery fee &amp; subscription benefits.

</run>
                <run bold='true'>Total DH Funded Amounts</run>
                <run> - Total incentive amount funded by DH in local currency. Including subscription benefits. This is the </run>
                <run bold='true'>north star KPI</run>
                <run> for the Customer Incentive Transactions stream and Correctness must be kept above 99.95%. 

</run>
                <run bold='true'>Total Vendor Funded Amounts </run>
                <run>- Total incentive amount funded by vendors in local currency. Including subscription benefits.
 
</run>
                <run bold='true'>Total 3Party Funded Amounts </run>
                <run>- Total incentive amount funded by 3Parties in local currency. Including subscription benefits.
 
</run>
                <run bold='true'>Place Timestamp Correctness</run>
                <run> - The percentage of Data Streams incentive transactions where the place timestamp matches to an accuracy of 1 second with the provided platform reconciliation table place timestamp.
 
</run>
                <run bold='true'>Total Number of Customer Incentives</run>
                <run>-The distinct count of customer_incentive_id from the CI stream vs the same count from the reconciliation_incentives table

</run>
                <run bold='true'>Total Number of Incentivised Orders</run>
                <run>-The distinct count of order_id from the CIT stream 

</run>
                <run bold='true'>% of Customer Incentive IDs</run>
                <run>-% of Customer Incentive IDs from the CIT stream that exist in the CI stream vs the same count from the reconciliation_incentive_transactions table.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='637' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='636' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone alt-text='Link to slack channel for questions' fixed-size='89' friendly-name='Slack Button' h='11667' id='14' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Slack Button.png' type-v2='bitmap' url='https://deliveryhero.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C03FHFH1NLX' w='7778' x='800' y='1000'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
